---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Kelly" description="Kelly makes fresh and crochet flower arrangements by hand in Singapore.">
  <article class="story wrap">
    <header>
      <h1>Kelly</h1>
      <p class="lede">Fresh flowers for the week, crochet flowers to keep, all made by one pair of hands in Singapore.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="photo-slot portrait">Portrait of Kelly at the worktable, natural light (see docs/shot-list.md)</div>

    <div class="body">
      <aside class="note small" role="note">Kelly will write this page. The prompts below are a guide, so the story is told in Kelly's own words.</aside>

      <h2>How it began</h2>
      <p class="prompt">When did you first make a bouquet, or a crochet flower? Who was it for?</p>

      <h2>Why both</h2>
      <p class="prompt">What does a fresh flower give that a crochet one can't, and the other way round? When do you reach for each?</p>

      <div class="photo-slot process">Kelly's hands mid stitch, close up, with the yarn and hook visible</div>

      <h2>How I work</h2>
      <p class="prompt">Where do your fresh stems come from? How long does a crochet rose take? What do you never compromise on?</p>

      <h2>A piece I remember</h2>
      <p class="prompt">One order that stayed with you, and why. Leave out names unless the customer agrees.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .story { padding-top: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  header { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 20vw, 19rem); text-transform: uppercase; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 880; line-height: 0.8; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .lede { font-family: var(--voice); font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.6vw, 1.9rem); line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 34ch; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 1.25rem; }
  .portrait { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }
  .process { aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; margin: 2.5rem 0; }
  .body { max-width: 720px; margin: 3rem auto 0; }
  .note { border: 2px solid var(--ink); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 2.8rem); text-transform: uppercase; font-stretch: 75%; margin: 2.75rem 0 0.75rem; }
  .prompt { font-family: var(--voice); font-style: italic; font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink-2); }
</style>
